== Trivia ==
* This item can also increase the odds of getting an {{r|Angel Room}}, despite being a Satanic book.
* It is one of the four books in the ''[[wikipedia:The Satanic Bible|Satanic Bible]]''.
* Belial is a name used for {{e|Satan}} in some Jewish and Christian texts.
* {{dlc|r}} This item is used in [[Bloody Mary]] (Challenge #37).
* {{dlc|r}} The previously unused item ID <code>59</code> is now occupied by the active/passive version of The Book of Belial, which is obtained when {{c|Judas}} or {{c|Black Judas}} has {{i|Birthright|n}}.
** Despite this, this version of the item is not obtainable by other characters. If you use {{i|Spindown Dice}} on an item pedestal of item ID <code>60</code>, {{i|The Ladder}}, it'll skip to {{i|Book of Shadows}}.
* {{dlc|r}} The effect of Notched Axe with {{c|Judas}}' and{{c|Black Judas}}' Birthright is a reference to [[wikipedia:Minecraft|Minecraft's]] enchanting mechanic.
** All of its upgrades are based on existing Minecraft enchantments — Unbreaking, Fire Aspect, Knockback, Efficiency, and Fortune.
** However, Fire Aspect and Knockback normally cannot be applied to pickaxes in ''Minecraft''.

